{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫59周年台慶盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，現年21歲憑藉出眾身材獲封「聲秀 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫59周年台慶盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，現年21歲憑藉出眾身材獲封「聲秀波波」藝人陳卓怡再次成為紅地氈焦點。她一改去年初登場時青澀怕羞形象，今年換上一襲極具設計感黑色馬甲公主裙高調亮相。這套暗黑系戰衣不僅完美修飾其傲人曲線，背後更隱藏著她過去一年經歷地獄式特訓蛻變痕跡。</p>\n<h2>陳卓怡出戰萬千星輝賀台慶2026紅地氈驚艷全場</h2>\n<p>事隔一年再次踏上台慶紅地氈，陳卓怡緊隨一眾《聲秀》戰友登場，以「暗黑公主風」全新造型示人。她當晚身穿一件復古大方領剪裁黑色晚裝，肩帶特別加入立體蝴蝶結蓬起設計，腰間結合透視薄紗與魚骨馬甲細節，下身則配以點綴立體蝴蝶結蓬鬆紗裙。在髮型方面，她梳起俐落高丸子頭並夾上黑色大蝴蝶結髮飾，配襯珍珠耳環與精緻銀色頸鍊，舉手投足間散發出輕熟名媛氣質，從容面對現場無數閃光燈。</p>\n<h2>聲秀人氣學員告別青澀展現輕熟名媛氣質</h2>\n<p>面對大批傳媒蜂擁追訪與鏡頭捕捉，陳卓怡全程展現出極高心理素質，不僅在紅地氈上從容微笑，在電視城外回眸一瞥亦充滿自信。回顧去年她首次參與台慶盛會並幸運抽中總值超過28萬元大獎時，當時仍是新人上台領獎顯得相當怕羞，面對鏡頭更頻頻伸手擋住胸前試圖封印傲人曲線。今年她完全擺脫昔日拘謹感，大方展現深邃事業線與纖細腰線，將性感與華麗演繹得淋漓盡致。</p>\n<p>\n<h2>網民翻出舊照對比激讚聲秀波波戰衣大進化</h2>\n<p>這套破格性感黑色禮服造型照在社交平台曝光後，隨即引發大批網民熱烈討論。不少忠實擁躉翻出她去年純白深V造型作直接對比，認為其氣場與衣著品味皆有顯著提升。網民紛紛在帖文下方留言激讚：「陳卓怡件黑色晚裝真係完美凸顯身材」、「今年紮起頭髮高貴咗好多，更有女人味」、「由去年怕羞妹變成今年自信女神，進步好大！」相關輿論反應迅速將相關照片推上社交平台熱門話題榜。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135740549195_7125658616b03f4adca79c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳卓怡 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135740549195_7125658616b03f4adca79c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p></p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542136136563186_20583897156b03f4b1d9cbf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542136136563186_20583897156b03f4b1d9cbf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\r\n                （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\r\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954213601064781_2378997326b03f4b095f64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954213601064781_2378997326b03f4b095f64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\r\n                （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\r\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135901621678_6855705806b03f4af630ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135901621678_6855705806b03f4af630ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\r\n                （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\r\n            </figcaption></figure>\n<h2>台慶紅地氈回顧｜聲秀陳卓怡Hoonry白色戰衣豐滿上圍震撼全場</h2>\n<p>年僅20歲的《聲秀》學員陳卓怡上年首次參與台慶紅地氈，雖然與一眾《聲秀》學員以大堆頭形式登場，但她憑藉一身白色低胸背心晚裝成功突圍而出。黑色束帶設計完美突顯她豐滿的上圍，低胸剪裁令「事業線」盡露，極度震撼眼球。在隨後的抽獎環節中，Hoonry幸運中獎上台領獎，偉大身材再次暴露於觀眾眼前，不過面對鏡頭時顯得相當怕羞，頻頻用手擋住胸前試圖「封印」豐滿曲線。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155518339296_6607475216_4708455006921607f5c661-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳卓怡 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155518339296_6607475216_4708455006921607f5c661-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509949910_6607475216_29841482369216081bcf28-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509949910_6607475216_29841482369216081bcf28-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\r\n                （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\r\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155677689864_6607475216_17784486166921607d1146e-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155677689864_6607475216_17784486166921607d1146e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\r\n                （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\r\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509938694_6607475216_12752163606921607acfce5-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509938694_6607475216_12752163606921607acfce5-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\r\n                （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\r\n            </figcaption></figure>\n<h2></h2>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%8d%93%e6%80%a1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳卓怡</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%ad%94%e9%9f%b3%e5%a5%b3%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">魔音女團</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：陳卓怡IG資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548708\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.341623+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1447,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:09:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:25.875517+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:25.875517+00:00","content_hash":"9cff8fa1bae3c85cae549ce35532bb22093e3ae9a72ad126aa5a2067a10ab9b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}